# UI/UX design theme - enterprise system

Dense, data-forward, SAP-inspired enterprise style. Calm neutral surfaces, one
strong brand blue, color reserved for status meaning - not decoration.

## Color tokens (use as CSS variables, never hardcode hex in components)

| Token | Hex | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `--color-primary` | #0854A0 | Top nav, primary buttons, active nav, links |
| `--color-primary-dark` | #1F3864 | Headers, emphasis text on light backgrounds |
| `--color-accent` | #2E74B5 | Secondary actions, chart accents |
| `--color-success` | #2E7D32 | Approved, completed, on-time |
| `--color-warning` | #B26A00 | On hold, correction raised, due soon |
| `--color-danger` | #B00020 | Rejected, overdue, validation errors |
| `--color-info` | #0277BD | Informational banners, waiting states |
| `--color-neutral-900` | #1A1A1A | Primary body text |
| `--color-neutral-500` | #6B7280 | Secondary text, captions |
| `--color-neutral-100` | #F2F2F2 | Table zebra striping, card backgrounds |
| `--color-surface` | #FFFFFF | Page/card background |
| `--color-border` | #D9DEE4 | Table borders, card outlines |

## Typography
- Font: Inter or Roboto, `system-ui` fallback.
- H1 24px/semibold (page titles), H2 18px/semibold (section/card headers),
  body 14px/regular, caption 12px/regular neutral-500, KPI numerics 20–28px
  semibold with tabular-nums.

## Layout & components
- Left sidebar nav (permission-filtered) + top bar with search/user menu.
- Content max-width ~1280px desktop; single column below 768px; test to 320px.
- Cards: 8px radius, 1px border, no heavy shadows.
- Status badges: pill-shaped, colored from the tokens above - every task/
  design/correction row gets exactly one.
- Buttons: primary = solid brand blue, secondary = outlined, destructive =
  red outline (filled only on final confirm step).
- Task timer widget: large monospace elapsed time, state-colored border
  (green running / amber on hold), single-tap hold/resume/end controls.
- Kanban view for Design Head task overview, grouped by sub-process column.
- Modals: focus-trapped, Escape to close, inline error region above the
  primary action.

## Required states - every data screen needs all four
- **Loading:** skeleton rows matching the final shape, never a blank screen.
- **Empty:** short explanation + the primary action that fixes it.
- **Error:** inline banner with the `CorrelationId` and a retry action.
- **Permission-denied:** explicit message naming the missing permission, not
  a generic 404.

## Accessibility
- WCAG 2.1 AA contrast minimum, including status badges.
- Full keyboard operability for timer and approval actions.
- ARIA labels on every icon-only button.
